{
  "$schema": "https://json-schema.org/draft/2020-12/schema",
  "$id": "urn:af:schema:performance-run:7",
  "title": "af.perf-run/7",
  "description": "A frozen comparison plan, run.json: resolved identities, each source's Cargo.lock digest read from its Git objects, authority digests, cases, seeded AB/BA schedule, sentinels and limits. The reader recomputes the plan digest, K, every rank, order and shard assignment; nothing rewrites a plan.",
